{"resourceIdentifier":"1806","resourceName":"Riscales REDD+ Project","description":"This project is an AFOLU project under REDD project category. Specifically, the project is of the Avoided Unplanned Deforestation & Degradation (AUDD) project category. The project is estimated to generate approximately 5.5 million VCUs over 30 years. The project area is located in the collective territory of Los Riscales in the Pacific coastal in the department of Chocó. Belonging to the biologically diverse Chocó-Darién bioregion.The project will have climate, community and biodiversity benefits. Climate benefits relate to the GHG emission reduction resulting from implementing the project, in particular due to the reduction in the rhythm of land use changes from forests to agriculture and livestock raising. Biodiversity benefits related to protection of High Conservation Values in one of the world´s megadiverse hotspots. And Community benefits through enhancing community livelihoods, and strengthening forest governance capacity.PUBLIC COMMENT PERIOD:This project is open for public comment from 14 November – 14 December 2018. <a href=mailto:secretariat@verra.org?subject=Riscales REDD+ Project comments>Submit comments from 14 November – 14 December 2018","location":{"latitude":5.690137,"longitude":-77.312893},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-04-06","endExclusive":"2020-05-07","endInclusive":"2020-05-06"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1806"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Chocó"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Consejo Comunitario General Los Riscales."},{"type":"string","value":"Yangon, Myanmar"},{"type":"string","value":"+951375292"},{"type":"string","value":"www.worldview.foundation"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"asse